                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                  %mo ≤
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                  %mi Z
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} |Y| \leq |Z|
            means there is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monomorphism"} monomorphism
            = succeed ".)" do
